From: StationConnect Engineering <engineering@stationconnect.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] avcodec/hevc: enable hardware formats for identity GBR

HEVC matrix_coeffs=0 changes the software pixel format for 10-bit 4:4:4
streams from YUV444P10 to GBRP10. The coded surface layout and hardware
profile remain Main 4:4:4 10, so offer the same hardware accelerators.

---
 libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c b/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c
index 8a845f5..349e0f3 100644
--- a/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c
+++ b/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c
@@ -678,6 +678,7 @@ static enum AVPixelFormat get_format(HEVCContext *s, const HEVCSPS *sps)
         *fmt++ = AV_PIX_FMT_CUDA;
 #endif
         break;
+    case AV_PIX_FMT_GBRP10:
     case AV_PIX_FMT_YUV444P10:
 #if CONFIG_HEVC_VIDEOTOOLBOX_HWACCEL
         *fmt++ = AV_PIX_FMT_VIDEOTOOLBOX;
-- 
2.50.1
